<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompt For PersonaMem</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the multiple-choice evaluation of PerosnaMem dataset, we adopted a strict prompt template to ensure consistency and avoid ambiguous model outputs. The instruction explicitly restricts the model to return exactly one option among <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(a)</span>, <span id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(b)</span>, <span id="A3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(c)</span>, or <span id="A3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(d)</span>, without any reasoning or additional text. This design prevents uncontrolled generation and makes results directly comparable across models.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="142.18" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 142.18" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,142.18) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#333333;" fill="#333333" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 136.27 C 0 139.53 2.64 142.18 5.91 142.18 L 544.09 142.18 C 547.36 142.18 550 139.53 550 136.27 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 118.22 L 548.03 118.22 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 126.82)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt Instruction</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:6.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="92.63" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 92.63)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
