<section id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Preliminaries.</h5>

<div id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let the user memory be <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}=\{m_{i}\}_{i=1}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}=\{m_{i}\}_{i=1}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math> with embeddings <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}_{i}=\phi(m_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}_{i}=\phi(m_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> and a query <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> encoded as <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{t}=\phi(q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{t}=\phi(q)</annotation></semantics></math>, with unit normalization.
Define similarity scores <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}=\langle\mathbf{x}_{t},\mathbf{z}_{i}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}=\langle\mathbf{x}_{t},\mathbf{z}_{i}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> and the probe list <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}=\texttt{Top-}K\big(\{(m_{i},s_{i})\}_{i=1}^{M}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}=\texttt{Top-}K\big(\{(m_{i},s_{i})\}_{i=1}^{M}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Following the paper, define a tempered softmax over probe scores</p>
<table id="A6.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{i}=\frac{\exp\!\big(\lambda(s_{i}-\max_{j}s_{j})\big)}{\sum_{j=1}^{K}\exp\!\big(\lambda(s_{j}-\max_{\ell}s_{\ell})\big)},\qquad i=1,\dots,K," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.370em;" width="1.370em"><mi>exp</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></msubsup><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.370em;" width="1.370em"><mi>exp</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{i}=\frac{\exp\!\big(\lambda(s_{i}-\max_{j}s_{j})\big)}{\sum_{j=1}^{K}\exp\!\big(\lambda(s_{j}-\max_{\ell}s_{\ell})\big)},\qquad i=1,\dots,K,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">with entropy <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="H(p)=-\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_{i}\log p_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H(p)=-\sum_{i=1}^{K}p_{i}\log p_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and mean similarity <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{s}=\frac{1}{K}\sum_{i=1}^{K}s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>s</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>K</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{s}=\frac{1}{K}\sum_{i=1}^{K}s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.
The RF-Mem selection is</p>
<table id="A6.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

