</table>
<p id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">In the Familiarity path, the retriever returns <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{Top-}K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{Top-}K</annotation></semantics></math> by <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.
In the Recollection path, the system iterates <em id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">retrieve–cluster–mix</em>: at round <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> it retrieves <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{Top-}N_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{Top-}N_{r}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{r}=(B+r)F\leq K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{r}=(B+r)F\leq K</annotation></semantics></math>, clusters into <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> groups with centroids <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}^{(r)}_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}^{(r)}_{b}</annotation></semantics></math>, and forms recollect queries</p>
<table id="A6.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{(r+1)}_{b}=\operatorname{norm}\big(\alpha\mathbf{x}^{(r)}+(1-\alpha)\mathbf{g}^{(r)}_{b}+\mathbf{x}_{t}\big),\quad b=1,\dots,B," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>norm</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{(r+1)}_{b}=\operatorname{norm}\big(\alpha\mathbf{x}^{(r)}+(1-\alpha)\mathbf{g}^{(r)}_{b}+\mathbf{x}_{t}\big),\quad b=1,\dots,B,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
