<p id="Thmproposition2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmproposition2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">If the true regime satisfies <math id="Thmproposition2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu\geq\theta_{\text{high}}+\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">high</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu\geq\theta_{\text{high}}+\delta</annotation></semantics></math> (familiar) or <math id="Thmproposition2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu\leq\theta_{\text{low}}-\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">low</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu\leq\theta_{\text{low}}-\delta</annotation></semantics></math> (unfamiliar), the probability of mis-selection due to mean estimation is bounded by <math id="Thmproposition2.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\exp(-K\delta^{2}/(2\sigma^{2}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\exp(-K\delta^{2}/(2\sigma^{2}))</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
