<p id="A6.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Proposition <a href="#Thmproposition2" title="Proposition 2 (Gating error bound via concentration) ‣ F.3 Sub-Gaussian Mean Similarity and Gating Reliability ‣ Appendix F Theoretical Analysis ‣ Evoking User Memory: Personalizing LLM via Recollection-Familiarity Adaptive Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> shows that increasing <math id="A6.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> tightens the reliability of the mean-based selection of the familiarity and the recollection paths.</p>
