<section id="A6.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.4 </span>Complexity–Coverage Trade-off</h3>

<div id="A6.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let the cost of a similarity evaluation be <math id="A6.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{\text{sim}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>sim</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{\text{sim}}</annotation></semantics></math> and of a <math id="A6.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>-way <math id="A6.SS4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-means update be <math id="A6.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{\text{clust}}(B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>clust</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{\text{clust}}(B)</annotation></semantics></math> on a batch of size <math id="A6.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{r}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmproposition3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_proposition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmproposition3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 3</span></span><span id="Thmproposition3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Complexity bounds)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmproposition3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmproposition3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmproposition3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Familiarity</span><span id="Thmproposition3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> has time <math id="Thmproposition3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{Fam}}=O(K\,c_{\text{sim}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Fam</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">sim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{Fam}}=O(K\,c_{\text{sim}})</annotation></semantics></math>.
<span id="Thmproposition3.p1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Recollection</span> with parameters <math id="Thmproposition3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(B,F,R)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(B,F,R)</annotation></semantics></math> has time</span></p>
<table id="A6.E22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{Rec}}=O\Big(\sum_{r=0}^{R}\big(N_{r}\,c_{\text{sim}}+c_{\text{clust}}(B)\big)\Big)=O\big(R\,(BF)\,c_{\text{sim}}+R\,c_{\text{clust}}(B)\big)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Rec</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><munderover><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>R</mi></munderover><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">sim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">clust</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0.170em">⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">sim</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">clust</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{Rec}}=O\Big(\sum_{r=0}^{R}\big(N_{r}\,c_{\text{sim}}+c_{\text{clust}}(B)\big)\Big)=O\big(R\,(BF)\,c_{\text{sim}}+R\,c_{\text{clust}}(B)\big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
